    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a product of my own brokenness\"... yeah, i guess. it just feels permanent. like the \"colors\" are all gone and it's just gray everywhere. i look at my old work and i don't even recognize it anymore. it's like i'm just waiting for everyone to realize i've got nothing left to give. how am i supposed to live with just being a shadow?",
